<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia's Pertamina to explore 178 wells in '97.</title>
<headline>Indonesia's Pertamina to explore 178 wells in '97.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's national oil company Pertamina will explore 178 wells this year, compared with 100 wells in 1996, Pertamina director of exploration, Priyambodo Mulyosudirdjo said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>&quot;We will explore 178 wells in 1997,&quot; he told reporters. &quot;Pertamina explored 100 wells last year.&quot;</p>
<p>Indonesia is Asia's sole member of the Organisation of Petroleum Exporting Countries (OPEC).</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom + 6221 384-6364</p>
